description	"Old Republic Trooper

^9Weapons:
- Melee
- Vibroknife ^9(Purple Saber)
^2-- Chain: 4
^1-- Defense: No
^1-- Length: 16
- Pulse Cannon ^9(Pulsethrower)
^2-- Damage: 1.5x
^1-- Mag Reload: .57x

^3Abilities:
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

^6Items:
- Advanced Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (3)
- Force Block (1)
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
^2- Armor Regen: 2/s > 25
^2- Resource Regen: 4/1.5s
^2- Knockback Given: 1.1x
^2- Knockback Taken: .9x

Durable multi-lifes with crowd control."